{"seq":2,"slug":"recording-transforms","title":"录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/recording-transforms","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"录制-insertable-streams-与-webcodecs\">录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs</h1><p>到这里，前端已经能采集、传输、播放音视频了。剩下三种「自定义产出与改造」的能力，是把前端从「用别人的管线」推进到「自建管线」的关键：把流录成文件（MediaRecorder）、在轨道中间插入逐帧处理（Insertable Streams）、直接驱动浏览器底层编解码器（WebCodecs）。这一篇把这三件利器讲透，它们共同构成前端音视频处理能力的天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三种 API 在抽象层级上由高到低排列，覆盖不同的控制粒度。MediaRecorder 最高层——一行配置就能把 <code>MediaStream</code> 录成文件，但几乎不可定制。Insertable Streams（正式名 mediacapture-transform，俗称 Breakout Box）居中——把轨道暴露成 WHATWG Streams 的帧流，让你在采集与编码之间插入逐帧变换。WebCodecs 最底层——直接给你 <code>VideoEncoder</code>/<code>VideoDecoder</code>，绕开所有高层封装自建管线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[MediaStreamTrack] --&gt; B[MediaRecorder&lt;br/&gt;整流录文件]&#10;  A --&gt; C[MediaStreamTrackProcessor&lt;br/&gt;轨道转帧流]&#10;  C --&gt; D[TransformStream&lt;br/&gt;逐帧处理]&#10;  D --&gt; E[MediaStreamTrackGenerator&lt;br/&gt;帧流转轨道]&#10;  E --&gt; F[送回 RTCPeerConnection / 渲染]&#10;  G[原始帧 VideoFrame] --&gt; H[WebCodecs VideoEncoder]&#10;  H --&gt; I[EncodedVideoChunk]&#10;  I --&gt; J[自定义封装/传输]\">flowchart TD\n  A[MediaStreamTrack] --&gt; B[MediaRecorder&lt;br/&gt;整流录文件]\n  A --&gt; C[MediaStreamTrackProcessor&lt;br/&gt;轨道转帧流]\n  C --&gt; D[TransformStream&lt;br/&gt;逐帧处理]\n  D --&gt; E[MediaStreamTrackGenerator&lt;br/&gt;帧流转轨道]\n  E --&gt; F[送回 RTCPeerConnection / 渲染]\n  G[原始帧 VideoFrame] --&gt; H[WebCodecs VideoEncoder]\n  H --&gt; I[EncodedVideoChunk]\n  I --&gt; J[自定义封装/传输]</pre><p>下表对比三者的控制粒度与典型用途，是选型起点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>抽象层级</th>\n<th>控制粒度</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MediaRecorder</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>整条流、容器级</td>\n<td>录屏、录通话、录笔记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insertable Streams</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>逐帧变换</td>\n<td>背景虚化、端到端加密、滤镜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebCodecs</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>编解码原语</td>\n<td>自建管线、转码、精确控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mediarecorder-把流录成文件\">MediaRecorder：把流录成文件</h2><p>MediaRecorder 是最省心的录制方案：给它一个 <code>MediaStream</code>，它按指定的 MIME 类型（容器+编解码器）持续吐出编码后的数据块（<code>Blob</code>），最后拼成文件。它能录摄像头、录屏幕（配合 getDisplayMedia）、甚至录 canvas 动画或 Web Audio 输出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getDisplayMedia({ video: true });&#10;const mime = &#39;video/webm; codecs=&quot;vp9, opus&quot;&#39;;&#10;if (!MediaRecorder.isTypeSupported(mime)) throw new Error(&#39;不支持该格式&#39;);&#10;&#10;const recorder = new MediaRecorder(stream, {&#10;  mimeType: mime,&#10;  videoBitsPerSecond: 2_500_000,&#10;});&#10;const chunks = [];&#10;recorder.ondataavailable = (e) =&gt; e.data.size &amp;&amp; chunks.push(e.data);&#10;recorder.onstop = () =&gt; {&#10;  const blob = new Blob(chunks, { type: mime });&#10;  download(URL.createObjectURL(blob));&#10;};&#10;recorder.start(1000); // 每秒产出一个数据块，便于增量上传\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.mediaDevices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDisplayMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ video: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'video/webm; codecs=\"vp9, opus\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MediaRecorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isTypeSupported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mime)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不支持该格式'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> recorder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MediaRecorder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stream, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mimeType: mime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  videoBitsPerSecond: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2_500_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chunks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">recorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ondataavailable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.data.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunks.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">recorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onstop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunks, { type: mime });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  download</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createObjectURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blob));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">recorder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每秒产出一个数据块，便于增量上传</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实务要点：用 <code>isTypeSupported</code> 探测格式（Safari 与 Chromium 支持的容器/编码不同，详见 <a href=\"debugging-interop\">调试、兼容与可观测性</a>）；<code>start(timeslice)</code> 传时间片可得到周期性数据块，适合边录边传；录出的 WebM 因实时生成常缺时长元数据，长录制后可能需要服务端 remux 修复。它依赖的容器与编解码器知识来自 <a href=\"../media-pipeline/codecs-formats\">编解码器与封装格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"insertable-streams-在轨道中间动手\">Insertable Streams：在轨道中间动手</h2><p>要在采集和编码之间逐帧改像素——背景虚化、美颜、贴纸、或对每帧加密——就用 Insertable Streams。它由两个对象组成：<code>MediaStreamTrackProcessor</code> 把轨道变成可读的 <code>VideoFrame</code> 流，<code>MediaStreamTrackGenerator</code> 把处理后的帧流变回轨道，中间用一个 <code>TransformStream</code> 做变换（来源：Chrome for Developers / W3C mediacapture-transform）。这套机制 Chrome 自 94 起支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const [track] = stream.getVideoTracks();&#10;const processor = new MediaStreamTrackProcessor({ track });&#10;const generator = new MediaStreamTrackGenerator({ kind: &#39;video&#39; });&#10;&#10;const transformer = new TransformStream({&#10;  async transform(frame, controller) {&#10;    const processed = await applyBackgroundBlur(frame); // 逐帧处理&#10;    frame.close(); // 必须释放！&#10;    controller.enqueue(processed);&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;processor.readable.pipeThrough(transformer).pipeTo(generator.writable);&#10;// generator 即新轨道，可 replaceTrack 送入 RTCPeerConnection&#10;const newStream = new MediaStream([generator]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVideoTracks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> processor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MediaStreamTrackProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ track });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> generator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MediaStreamTrackGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ kind: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'video'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transformer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TransformStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">controller</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> processed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applyBackgroundBlur</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(frame); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 逐帧处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    frame.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必须释放！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    controller.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enqueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(processed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">processor.readable.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipeThrough</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transformer).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipeTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(generator.writable);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// generator 即新轨道，可 replaceTrack 送入 RTCPeerConnection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newStream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MediaStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([generator]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最关键的纪律是内存管理：<code>VideoFrame</code> 持有 GPU/系统内存，处理完必须 <code>frame.close()</code>，否则迅速耗尽内存导致管线停摆。Insertable Streams 还是 SFU 端到端加密（E2EE）的实现基础——因为 SFU 不解密媒体（见 <a href=\"../realtime/sfu-mcu-topologies\">SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑</a>），需在编码后的帧上加一层只有参会者能解的加密，这通过 RTCRtpSender 的 <code>createEncodedStreams()</code>（encoded transform）完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"webcodecs-直达底层编解码器\">WebCodecs：直达底层编解码器</h2><p>当高层 API 都不够用时——要自建转码管线、做帧级精确控制、对接非标准容器、或在 worker 里高性能处理——用 WebCodecs。它把浏览器内置的硬件加速编解码器直接暴露给 JS：<code>VideoEncoder</code>、<code>VideoDecoder</code>、<code>AudioEncoder</code>、<code>AudioDecoder</code>，以及 <code>VideoFrame</code>、<code>EncodedVideoChunk</code> 等数据类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const encoder = new VideoEncoder({&#10;  output: (chunk, meta) =&gt; sendChunk(chunk), // 拿到编码后的数据块&#10;  error: (e) =&gt; console.error(e),&#10;});&#10;encoder.configure({&#10;  codec: &#39;av01.0.05M.08&#39;, // AV1 Profile 0，8-bit&#10;  width: 1280,&#10;  height: 720,&#10;  bitrate: 1_500_000,&#10;  framerate: 30,&#10;});&#10;// 从 Insertable Streams 拿到的 VideoFrame 直接编码&#10;encoder.encode(videoFrame, { keyFrame: false });&#10;videoFrame.close();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VideoEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 拿到编码后的数据块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">configure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  codec: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'av01.0.05M.08'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// AV1 Profile 0，8-bit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  width: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1280</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  height: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">720</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bitrate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1_500_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  framerate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 从 Insertable Streams 拿到的 VideoFrame 直接编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(videoFrame, { keyFrame: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">videoFrame.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>2026 年 WebCodecs 的 AV1 解码在桌面 Chrome/Edge/Firefox 近乎普及，编码在约 88% 会话可用（需正确 codec string、Profile 0、8-bit；来源：webcodecsfundamentals.org, 2026）。WebCodecs 常与 Insertable Streams、WebTransport、WebAssembly 组合成完全自定义的低延迟管线——绕开 WebRTC 的整套协商，自己掌控编码、打包、传输每一环。选用前务必用 <code>VideoEncoder.isConfigSupported()</code> 探测能力，并准备 H.264 兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种 API 按控制粒度排列：MediaRecorder（整流录文件）→ Insertable Streams（逐帧变换）→ WebCodecs（编解码原语）。</li>\n<li>MediaRecorder 用 <code>isTypeSupported</code> 探测格式、<code>start(timeslice)</code> 边录边传；WebM 缺时长元数据常需服务端 remux。</li>\n<li>Insertable Streams 用 Processor/Generator + TransformStream 在轨道中间逐帧处理；<code>VideoFrame</code> 用完必须 <code>close()</code> 防内存耗尽。</li>\n<li>它是 SFU 场景端到端加密的实现基础（经 encoded transform），因为 SFU 不解密媒体。</li>\n<li>WebCodecs 直达硬件编解码器，自建管线；2026 年 AV1 解码近普及、编码约 88% 可用，须 <code>isConfigSupported</code> 探测 + H.264 兜底。</li>\n<li>浏览器间格式与 API 差异显著，落地需对照 <a href=\"debugging-interop\">调试、兼容与可观测性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs","id":"录制-insertable-streams-与-webcodecs"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MediaRecorder：把流录成文件","id":"mediarecorder-把流录成文件"},{"level":2,"text":"Insertable Streams：在轨道中间动手","id":"insertable-streams-在轨道中间动手"},{"level":2,"text":"WebCodecs：直达底层编解码器","id":"webcodecs-直达底层编解码器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Web Audio 与音频处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/webaudio-processing"},"next":{"title":"调试、兼容与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/debugging-interop"}}